{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/extras/3e50d8fee247511abb1266572a56cd7b.avif?t=1763064196\" width=1312 height=654 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Chill</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Resource Chill</strong>, the <i>coziest factory sim you didn\u2019t know you needed</i>.<br>Build a tiny world of whirring machines, bubbling wells, and very confused conveyor belts \u2014 all working together (mostly) in harmony.<br>Research stuff, automate stuff, and then sit back and <i>watch your production loops do their thing</i>. It\u2019s like meditation, but with spreadsheets in disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/extras/4499420bad2f51817c6dfb1a84990f27.poster.avif?t=1763064196\" width=768 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/extras/4499420bad2f51817c6dfb1a84990f27.webm?t=1763064196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/extras/4499420bad2f51817c6dfb1a84990f27.mp4?t=1763064196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/extras/f0137edbf89c967cd02b800630846db4.poster.avif?t=1763064196\" width=768 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/extras/f0137edbf89c967cd02b800630846db4.webm?t=1763064196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/extras/f0137edbf89c967cd02b800630846db4.mp4?t=1763064196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/extras/bb0fb077254c481f6e24bbdcc0d35411.poster.avif?t=1763064196\" width=768 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/extras/bb0fb077254c481f6e24bbdcc0d35411.webm?t=1763064196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/extras/bb0fb077254c481f6e24bbdcc0d35411.mp4?t=1763064196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel-Art Automation</strong> \u2013 Place cute little machines that turn one thing into another, and another, and another... until you forget what you started with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Gather shiny objects to unlock shinier objects that make your less-shiny objects faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Save Support</strong> \u2013 Three save slots so you can test wild ideas, bad ideas, and \u201cwhy not?\u201d ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prototype Stage</strong> \u2013 The first taste of something much bigger. Think of it as early-access energy without the existential dread.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>33 Machines</strong> \u2013 From humble wells and farms to mighty refineries and fishing ships that definitely know what they\u2019re doing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>66 Recipes \u00d7 6 Upgrades Each</strong> \u2013 Because why have one upgrade when you can have six?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>66 Unique Items</strong> \u2013 Gather, smelt, grind, refine, and question your life choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Stages</strong> \u2013 Each with its own vibe, layout, and slightly more ways to overthink your factory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Upgrade System</strong> \u2013 Speed! Efficiency! Extra output! Everything your inner automation nerd could dream of.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Save Slots</strong> \u2013 For science. Or chaos. Your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental Growth</strong> \u2013 No stress, no explosions \u2014 just calm, satisfying progress (and maybe a few clicking sounds).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future Expansion</strong> \u2013 More machines! More recipes! More upgrades! Because your productivity addiction deserves more fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the Companies You\u2019ll Work With</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your factory doesn\u2019t just hum for fun \u2014 you\u2019ve got clients.<br>Each company has its own <i>vibes</i>, <i>goals</i>, and <i>questionable management style</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <strong>Factorio</strong>, <strong>Satisfactory</strong>, and <strong>Islanders</strong> had a chill little cousin who just wants good vibes and automation \u2014<br>that\u2019s <i>Resource Chill</i>. It\u2019s an incremental builder about creativity, satisfying loops, and the simple joy of watching a machine <i>do exactly what it\u2019s supposed to</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So grab your blueprints, take a deep breath, and get ready to <i>chill responsibly.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4115100?t=1763064196","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/e32479db6d09f5dcac65d07e56b49a08bc98960b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763064196","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/0165483168e4b955ca8867feb8f98567e4915949/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763064196","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/0165483168e4b955ca8867feb8f98567e4915949/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763064196","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/extras/3e50d8fee247511abb1266572a56cd7b.avif?t=1763064196\" width=1312 height=654 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Chill</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Resource Chill</strong>, the <i>coziest factory sim you didn\u2019t know you needed</i>.<br>Build a tiny world of whirring machines, bubbling wells, and very confused conveyor belts \u2014 all working together (mostly) in harmony.<br>Research stuff, automate stuff, and then sit back and <i>watch your production loops do their thing</i>. It\u2019s like meditation, but with spreadsheets in disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/extras/4499420bad2f51817c6dfb1a84990f27.poster.avif?t=1763064196\"