paragraph\" ><strong>Research &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Gather shiny objects to unlock shinier objects that make your less-shiny objects faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Save Support</strong> \u2013 Three save slots so you can test wild ideas, bad ideas, and \u201cwhy not?\u201d ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prototype Stage</strong> \u2013 The first taste of something much bigger. Think of it as early-access energy without the existential dread.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>33 Machines</strong> \u2013 From humble wells and farms to mighty refineries and fishing ships that definitely know what they\u2019re doing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>66 Recipes \u00d7 6 Upgrades Each</strong> \u2013 Because why have one upgrade when you can have six?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>66 Unique Items</strong> \u2013 Gather, smelt, grind, refine, and question your life choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Stages</strong> \u2013 Each with its own vibe, layout, and slightly more ways to overthink your factory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Upgrade System</strong> \u2013 Speed! Efficiency! Extra output! Everything your inner automation nerd could dream of.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Save Slots</strong> \u2013 For science. Or chaos. Your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental Growth</strong> \u2013 No stress, no explosions \u2014 just calm, satisfying progress (and maybe a few clicking sounds).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future Expansion</strong> \u2013 More machines! More recipes! More upgrades! Because your productivity addiction deserves more fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the Companies You\u2019ll Work With</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your factory doesn\u2019t just hum for fun \u2014 you\u2019ve got clients.<br>Each company has its own <i>vibes</i>, <i>goals</i>, and <i>questionable management style</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <strong>Factorio</strong>, <strong>Satisfactory</strong>, and <strong>Islanders</strong> had a chill little cousin who just wants good vibes and automation \u2014<br>that\u2019s <i>Resource Chill</i>. It\u2019s an incremental builder about creativity, satisfying loops, and the simple joy of watching a machine <i>do exactly what it\u2019s supposed to</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So grab your blueprints, take a deep breath, and get ready to <i>chill responsibly.</i></p>","developers":["Asfar GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115100/759b09ba14a78b02fdbbe29519a54efd93e8df16/header.jpg?t=1763064196","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E6320 (2*1866) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 7600 GS (512 MB) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4115100/789623019/b5db33a617c99484633177382667cb87dae990a6/1760927128/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761264737","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4115100/789623019/b5db33a617c99484633177382667cb87dae990a6/1760927128/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761264737","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4115100/789623019/b5db33a617c99484633177